            "rationale": "The allocation order and amounts have one definition, `Accounts.allocate`. The fully-paid predicate `covered >= fine.Amount` is written separately in the account view and twice in `ofPayment`, rather than being defined once in Tier 2. The copies agree, so this is a 1.",
