                "quote": "if Accounts.owed (MemberId m) library >= 5.00m then"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The CLI is Tier 4 presentation. The change replaces its inline arithmetic with a call to the Tier 2 function `Lending.Transition.Accounts.owed`. This is a new violation of ARC-BND-02, because presentation re-enters a Tier 2 function directly. The CLI also still loads the store itself (`ports.Store.Load()`) to make the borrow decision, instead of letting a Tier 3 use case coordinate it. The new `waive` use case and the JSON codec change are otherwise wired correctly through `commit` and the existing ports.",
